{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1498,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4396cfa2efc27a3fca7c81af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名流等级，上升！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b25dcf47ceffd919fe8f504f286aff576add8d9bfd8be516a1c95fd168cd8b1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0df8a9a533d1d3f0a1b19222",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更更更闪耀了哦☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcdc5590f9b249f46123503260352d4a087d940aab0e506b6048430fc3127938",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af934087e5de75a228921d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "闪闪发光的我变身☆\n一起好好享受假期吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "920aba012cd0a6a2897805236974928319685a7537fc4f1f32d66082ab417793",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e7cae817c839f87868ff686",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是强击哦！\n带着度假的心情出发吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "5f321bc396dff3247d1f2d5d052500cd5cee5bb1d82bfd2f5dc7a8fdd65ecdb7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1091",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31507fb00ed56c4857ac2ec6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始紧张了～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f57e4c0f62171346061d8dcfad68692d7e50cb694e73e6ce63fd32169eab3d6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b2cc461de3a0e9258c24d31",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的梦想真正开始，是在你选择了\n我的时候。…绝对要一起跑完全\n程，我已经这么决定了",
      "source_fingerprint": "db5928a26893988222962ff17d313aba53f2038a50c2b693dcdd806538cb3aa5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869eaa12651adcb69c2bc704",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e034c489108d426004b6dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a4c766384c4629dc337c0275",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕只有一个人，觉得我是特别的，\r\n就一定能成为主角。\r\n我现在就是这么相信的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db2fd10b733c1b848bb213c5e266822aea86c18363899d67cf1964a425470b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337cbe0f6353e78e6994c90c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对这个人，我想了解更多！能\r\n产生这样的念头，原来很幸福啊……\r\n最近，我常常这么想。",
      "source_fingerprint": "23c961b9693f503c194e3f22584e67d0955e3aa2dfbf2578ee53d356734b7053",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9b9f4a300344c08c5ff1f77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您写新年试笔了吗？\r\n我写的是『主角』……不过每年\r\n都是同一个字呢……诶嘿嘿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a42cb2cd4f7a3eab1974b6077f43ccaa6cbf6d342a8316c47b7f7ace373089",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:796da4e4d178510b447e0066",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为做得有点过头成了牛奶加倍\r\n的巧克力……牛奶的分量，\r\n就当作心意的分量吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "01d97a7fca01ce1377dd33a8a5bb3a8f86de4b7d48f7faf1ab90dc2332f8e896",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2119e9083c373fd708554133",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "倾注真心做出的巧克力味道会变得特别……\r\n虽然我不知道是不是真有这种事\r\n……那个，这是我竭尽全力做出的……作品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e43f2f65f9bc2175af1b1c755dd44beabbfcb31501e00662961ce20ab764992a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd6c50674cf2d84462df1d21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼。帮大家把短笺挂好后\r\n就结束了……等等，啊啊！？\r\n我的愿望，忘记写了…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dad0354236e669b8cbbd7b2dfa21fb2fc062fa2c227630171423914dde99364",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f4f260e3a40f6d5af354774",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是的～，大家每年都想得出各种\r\n恶作剧……希望今年我也能\r\n做出精彩的反应…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ad5de29172dc623bf2d3aa06ef618ac92e84f16387bee1fe08b966fbeea3000",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:927395cc02e8873e3740bc65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍的礼物交换会，每年都想当\n圣诞老人来着……可猜拳\n输了，今年又要当驯鹿了～",
      "source_fingerprint": "f0a433d3cf9e9a65bed7b296a98ec6470f7eff47fbb5154ec9c9b94c63495399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a62c7e856d0a886d9db0319",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "选草莓奶油蛋糕，还是冻芝士蛋糕……\r\n小时候，我真的会为选哪一个\r\n认真烦恼……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75ece269c982c502aa4465828871c2cbb7d268a0a7d520688d7d0383f528bb0b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59a856ad5a68de2c3f475159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我也做到了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d5102fd7fee7dfa5ca9bc48cc7a5cb4573c85934ba80cfc8a95bcae0297450",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a25698f383a70ecc58eca52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼～，大扫除，大扫除，继续干。\r\n宿舍走廊已经弄完了，接下来\r\n该把浴室打扫干净咯～…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82c399189c72e53c5bffe1a37b49771c74743a2b6235b823036147c65b9ef3b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcae1292f15ddd6403237e3e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日蛋糕，已经在推荐的店里\r\n预约好了。…也许庆祝方式\r\n太老套了……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6030712700e6acfcc7aa13cc7afe43308bcab4bc60e9bda968cc9772eb489236",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79b98811d3986c1b1df3159",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日会的准备，已经做好了\r\n……为了让您真切地感受到，自己是主角，\r\n是特别的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11155ba7de77f76cf298bfc6ce880975a3e130583e4cbaa95294bc5a60cf3964",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec7a2426059bd831ce2b1dbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从以前起，我就喜欢\r\n吹灭蛋糕蜡烛的那一刻。\r\n那会让我觉得自己才是主角！我很喜欢这种感觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ae16939be77c6c23791d4cab0ff5affc194e30ed509dd48df9f33fa75a9df8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93d451472df4dd73db5db80b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……真不可思议啊。被训练员\r\n祝贺的时候……就会觉得自己\r\n是不是世界上最特别的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3006f6b40003c95b176771ff6e1bee5fbae90293983f54a8c006bd478f6d1080",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ca37e55bf3328484d02ac8b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员有通知哦。\r\n啊，要是您忙的话，\r\n我可以代您看一下哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec0f11dd26d61c5a60232a386c9958775460fd6835acd63947b286cb18b90598",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:118c56305945ab8d0adf86e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有礼物送到了呢。\r\n好期待啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e918defe21924da20783a96f21c80b258a0e91a86a334f2097775915d364626d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:212834709f0f8bf881afdd53",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，已经有完成的任务了。\r\n真不愧是专业人士，厉害啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "2a5906d31909b8af9320f4bda23df45cf8e58f55836c31c41014b86c8f90a427",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d81d45d26a5d936c18b80bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像要举办活动了呢\r\n朋友好像也会参加，\r\n我也不能输啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ed4fb88078528019b8a1a64da9689eb42c44c80b64fa09cbc1772f7e3b29e58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa8162d21a379245dab1375a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办中哦。\r\n能不能当上主角要看表现……\r\n只能加油了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66bc59ece95c0dc852ededd14862b068f209be11e968400e5dc8eaec51af03f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80b315be811c3574e854ddbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然，还是不行吗…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cfc1e379b9d571cf077c1c5d792676b8e200fa5a885b79331bc44e6ca125da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b5e5f5cf1789b6529052afa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级\r\n好像提升了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "23d755015d39ad870056f42adf9316239a21850556b828ebe7c06a0dc6c0410d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b02592814d7e22f6e03ad87a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢兜帽内侧的刺绣。\r\n看起来不起眼却暗藏惊艳\r\n的感觉，这一点，我也想学学",
      "source_fingerprint": "d8ad6b782c65bca1a82ffd380a5d851b6634caa8d11bce180c250ecaa9d7c46f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:202101f8fa590b8aa4678d7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "外套可以在突然下雨时当伞用……\r\n也帮朋友挡过好几次雨呢，\r\n所以是件很可靠的衣服哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06da9b77272cbf162d66ca3950b07453fb9e4ee6a462ca033735036f416c7f1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8963610bad315d7da192c1aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "搭配虽然不算花哨\r\n但我想着项链一定要特别闪亮！怀着\r\n这个想法，我把零花钱都花在上面了",
      "source_fingerprint": "11377ebbd72c7c7529d0b06d876aca030e4980d071ca2397e238b5ace17c476c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f20e058cf29a6c616d428b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好强…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "936b7cdf84f862a09214797cc4ecb03cd48c6ef7ecb9b879ca17e374af3023fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4157cfb5606a6b25a9263b95",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都是主角呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb3775be9af0b971113561bf91ef43c0200249bfa18a643dde4304b389ae75a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b99382b0257cdbb16418d7fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "果然，还是不行吗…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "92cfc1e379b9d571cf077c1c5d792676b8e200fa5a885b79331bc44e6ca125da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc0068de2415e5fd3fee806",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔，好强…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "936b7cdf84f862a09214797cc4ecb03cd48c6ef7ecb9b879ca17e374af3023fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf69a40115a0917d806c3f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶诶！？真的！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bc7ab4f426da60398ca27bf8777a89897d45c30d8440084ae62295ee640c415",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cbd211f677185289815e3604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家，一起加油吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f271104311b6a4f560215183e96f985902a8005901c389898a651f0a43bf6989",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74ff8744e629315ad54c211d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:456f94ba9e2eaf0ac7a99606",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要训练吗？\r\n好！无论什么训练项目\r\n我都热烈欢迎！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4786ce93f19197de45385f890595b4cae304cfe054ff00a4f01b33d653ad7d55",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:641825ae5365687ac88aceff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学园的历史啊。\r\n一定有非常多\r\n“主角”吧…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c5eb939f791aab73ea2dc26456408cb40ed36f389a552d5b7566022b3108d64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45f5ab115035d488be879645",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，是比赛吗？\r\n热身运动，我会先做好！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ebe16b32a11765f6c4901d7443e5c6f1439fdb21b921eeef45caf960285af01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1092",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1b8884459f6c0e83ae8a096",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定会成为最引人注目的那个！",
